Conflicts: guacd, libguac-client-rdp0
Description: remote access gateway based on Apache Guacamole
 BetterGuac is a clientless remote desktop gateway for SSH, RDP, VNC and
 Telnet, built on Apache Guacamole 1.6.0. This package installs everything
 on one machine: guacd (with the FreeRDP 3 post-connect graphics fix), the
 web application on Tomcat 10, MariaDB storage, two-factor sign-in, the
 BetterGuac interface and profile extension, SSH keys referenced by file
 path, and the YAML-to-database sync tool.
 .
 A fresh install creates an empty database with a random password and one
 administrator account. No servers, users or keys are included.
